# STIG CNTR-K8-003230: The Kubernetes kubelet config must have file permissions set
# STIG ID: V-242456 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `k8s-cntr-k8-003230-kubelet-config-perms-v2-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `kubernetes`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG CNTR-K8-003230: The Kubernetes kubelet config must have file permissions set to 644 or more rest`
    description `The Kubernetes kubelet config must have file permissions set to 644 or more restrictive.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `kubernetes,stig,disa-stig,permissions`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:CNTR-K8-003230,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `CM-6`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Kubernetes:cluster:k8s-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for CNTR-K8-003230.`

    component_id `comp-k8s-cluster`

    impl_CM_6 `This control is validated by checking the required Kubernetes configuration against the DISA STIG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        path `/var/lib/kubelet/config.yaml`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE meta_check
        exists boolean = true
        permissions string = `0644`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_metadata
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF meta_check
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
